  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Resource Pack-16x-green?style=plastic\" /> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/buy me a coffee-support-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/870825743788158986?color=blue&amp;style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/my other-projects-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/get%20a%20server-click%20here-blue?style=plastic\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">簡介</span></p>\n<p>專為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計的自訂準心。現已作為獨立項目發布。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">詳細介紹</span></p>\n<p>透過將標準的原版準心替換為更小巧的設計，進一步提升你的原版遊戲體驗。此準心非常適合用於 PvP 或 RPG 環境，在單人模式或一般伺服器中同樣適用。</p>\n<p><br />正在尋找更多準心、字體或資源包嗎？歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\">這裡</a> 查看我的其他作品</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/794/2023-12-19_01.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\" />&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/434/158/dec51e74-03ba-4abb-920c-bdc47a4e302a.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/Gamerpotionplus/videos\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/418/619/gp-subscribe.jpg\" /></a></p>",
